topsbot_ppocr
Copyright 2026 TOPSBOT contributors

This product includes PP-OCR (DB text detection + CRNN/CTC recognition) inference backend for TOPSBOT MES20 boards.

Implementation references the PaddleOCR sample pipelines for preprocessing, postprocessing,
and runtime usage (det_db / rec_ctc).

PP-OCR model files (.nb) are not distributed with this repository; see scripts/download_models.sh
and config/models_manifest.yaml.

Original PP-OCR models are developed by PaddlePaddle and released under the Apache License 2.0.
See https://github.com/PaddlePaddle/PaddleOCR for details.